flowchart LR
    C["Caller"] -->|"requests V2<br/>with expected values"| K["MPC contract<br/>(stores request,<br/>expected values hash<br/>and block height<br/>by yield id,<br/>emits the id)"]
    K -->|"indexed by every node"| L["Leader<br/>(takes an asset if needed,<br/>then inspects)"]
    L -->|"Start"| F["Followers<br/>(inspect, derive<br/>their own outcome)"]
    F -->|"signed outcome<br/>with share"| L
    L -->|"signature over request,<br/>block height, yield id<br/>and outcome"| K
    K -->|"returns the response with<br/>the signature and the outcome"| C
    L -.->|"disagreement,<br/>or out of attempts"| I["Inconclusive round<br/>(signers check the leader<br/>and the evidence)"]
    I -.->|"signature over the inconclusive<br/>for that yield"| K
